data: {"id": "d30a3a82e2d64871-thinking-parallel_evidence-1201", "run_id": "d30a3a82e2d64871", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Now I have all the critical evidence. Let me synthesize the findings.\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod YAML 核心事实 (`kubectl_get_yaml pod/workload -n aiops-case-11`)\n- **phase**: `Running`（YAML 返回的 phase），但 describe 显示 `Terminating`\n- **deletionTimestamp**: `2026-09-03T22:31:03Z`（已存在）\n- **finalizers**: `aiops.lab/hold`（自定义 finalizer，未完成清理）\n- **deletionGracePeriodSeconds**: `0`（设为0，无宽限）\n- **terminationGracePeriodSeconds**: `10`\n- **nodeName**: `node2`\n- **containerStatuses**: `app` 容器 `ready=False`, `restarts", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788477427398, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

